</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details of Figure <a href="#S1.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ Relevance to Utility: Process-Supervised Rewrite for RAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Details of Figure ‣ Relevance to Utility: Process-Supervised Rewrite for RAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> demonstrates that among the evaluated baselines, <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bge-reranker-large</span> achieves the best average performance, and we therefore use it as the representative baseline in Figure <a href="#S1.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 1 Introduction ‣ Relevance to Utility: Process-Supervised Rewrite for RAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.
For each subset, we randomly sample 500 examples.</p>
</div>
